As far as I knew, bothtelnetandnctransmit only what is input, with no protocol or any other wrapping around it. So why, whenenumerating port 4386, did one work, and the other not?


I opened up Wireshark, started a capture, and for each connected, typedhelpat the first prompt, and hit Enter. On first look, they looked exactly the same.


